ure trends.  \n- If you suspect **Yellow Leaf Disease** (viral) because the yellowing is uniform and persistent, contact a local agronomist or the district agricultural office for certified disease‑free planting material and possible hot‑water treatment of setts.", "fact_check": "checked", "fact_check_seconds": 1.65, "groq_calls": [{"purpose": "rewrite", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "seconds": 10.14, "status": "error", "seq": 21}, {"purpose": "answer", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "prompt_tokens": 1963, "completion_tokens": 937, "seconds": 36.69, "status": "ok", "seq": 22}, {"purpose": "fact_check", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 1464, "completion_tokens": 648, "seconds": 1.65, "status": "ok", "seq": 23}]}
